  "notes": "ABS GFS Annual 2024-25 Public Non-Financial Corporations operating statements for Australia (all levels) and the eight state/territory jurisdictions. Only the published \"Total GFS revenue\" and \"Total GFS expenses\" rows for FY2024-25 are ingested; units are $m confirmed from workbook row 6. Every row is an official aggregate: jurisdiction_level=pnfc, measure_type=actual, verified=true, data_quality_flag=verified, aggregation_role=benchmark. ABS GFS PNFC is a top-down sector aggregate supplied by the ABS. It is a benchmark, not a sum of projects or entities. Never add it to SOC/entity, government, charity or project data, and never sum across jurisdictions or across revenue/expense flows. Bytes are archived outside the repo."
